      "content": "<p>Finding the right rental neighborhood in Bangalore, which has rapidly grown and made the neighborhoods to look really diverse, can be a pretty rough task. And making real informed decisions is crucially important while you are considering your lifestyle needs and trying to get your living situation in Bangalore proper. Here's a rundown of the most important factors that will help guide you through this process.<br></p><h2><b>Key Takeaways</b></h2><p><b>Locality:</b> Research and choose a neighborhood to stay in, within a reasonable distance from your workplace.<br><b>Budget:</b> You would budget reasonable rent and other living expenses.<br><b>Amenities:</b> Check any good schools, hospitals, or grocery stores in the nearby facilities.<br><b>Safety:</b> Explore the crime rates and policies of community safety.<br><b>Rental agreement:</b> Read the fine print before signing on the dotted line.<br></p><h2><b>Locality and Neighborhood Characteristics</b></h2><p></p><h3><b>Importance of Locality</b></h3><p>Localities figure highly in your personal life in Bangalore. Some of the most popular neighborhoods, HSR Layout, Bellandur, and Whitefield give a thriving feel, with places of work within easy reach. Each of these localities is unique in its own way:<br></p><table data-theme=\"{\" themename\":\"theme1\",\"themeobj\":{\"tblpr\":{\"cell\":{\"borders\":{\"border-top\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-right\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-left\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-bottom\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"}}}}}}\"=\"\" data-cols=\"[{\" wt\":\"1.219in\"},{\"wt\":\"3.146in\"},{\"wt\":\"2.656in\"}]\"=\"\" data-width=\"7.02in\" data-table-name=\"Table_1\" class=\"zw-table\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000768026\" style=\"margin-left: 0in;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><tbody><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-t2khbcuf7akt\",\"type\":\"row\"