margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Growing residential area with parks and schools</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"2\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 254.976px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Families and young professionals</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Select a locality close to where you work, so you save yourself from all that unpredictable traffic Bangalore is infamous for. Ideally, it makes a lot of sense to stay in a neighborhood within 5 km radius of your workplace, which will drastically reduce your travel time.<br></p><h3><b>Safety Considerations</b></h3><p>Safety is one of the concerns when choosing a neighborhood. Know about the crime rates of places that are of interest to you and choose such neighborhoods where active measures towards safety exist. Think of security as a plus when you find neighborhoods with gated societies</p><div><br></div><p></p><p></p>",
