      "content": "<h2><b>Budget Considerations</b></h2><h3><b>Setting a Realistic Budget</b></h3><p><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/properties/bengaluru\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Apartments for Rent in Bangalore</a> are going to eat up most of your Salary. You will have to set an absolute budget for this rental. Your budget should include not only rent but these other things also:</p><ul><li>Utilities (water, electricity)</li><li>Maintenance charges</li><li>Transportation costs</li><li>Groceries and other living expenses</li></ul><p></p><p>Here are various prices for rentals in Bangalore, depending upon where you want to rent and what else, of course, you get. You'll pay more for a home in a prime area like HSR Layout than you would if you lived in one of the outlying neighborhoods.<br></p><h3><b>Average Rental Costs</b></h3><p data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000768026\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Here’s a breakdown of average rental costs in some popular neighborhoods:</span></p><p></p><table data-theme=\"{\" themename\":\"theme1\",\"themeobj\":{\"tblpr\":{\"cell\":{\"borders\":{\"border-top\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-right\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-left\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-bottom\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"}}}}}}\"=\"\" data-cols=\"[{\" wt\":\"2.302in\"},{\"wt\":\"4.708in\"}]\"=\"\" data-width=\"7.01in\" data-table-name=\"Table_2\" class=\"zw-table\" style=\"m