ine;\">               Hennur</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 451.968px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">                                                  ₹15,000 - ₹25,000</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Source: <a href=\"https://www.99acres.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">99 Acres</a><br>Understanding these costs can help you make informed decisions about where to live without overspending.<br></span></p><h2><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Commute and Connectivity</b></span></h2><p></p><h3><b>Importance of Connectivity</b></h3><p>The rental neighborhood in Bangalore should be chosen in accordance with the commute options. Travel can become relatively easy and convenient with buses and metro stations. Well-connected areas, including Bellandur, contain multiple commute options.<br></p><p></p><h3><b>Traffic Conditions</b></h3><p>Bangalore traffic may be rather unpredictable. Therefore, it is advisable to check the traffic trends at peak times for your possible route of travel. This will enable you to fairly know how much time you would have to waste when traveling daily.</p><p></p><h2><b>Amenities and Facilities</b></h2><h3><span style=\"vertical-align: bas